==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*3 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**7 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Fallen Bear]]s spawn, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage will prove to be a challenge if you're unprepared. Bring [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]] to snipe the backliners consistently, as well as [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]] for general DPS since they outrange every enemy here. [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] are recommended to deal with the Malizabeths. Zuches will be the biggest X factor here, so bring [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] IF availble. Generally, anything that pierces will be a great help here.

Your win condition is to exhaust the Zuches and Z-Kill Lord Gravey as soon as possible. Afterwards, the dragons can take care of Fallen Bear as long as you have enough space. Money may be a huge concern as well, so don't go wasting it all in one place.

